---
description: Money-maths guardrails for the Edgeways calc engine and offers logic
globs: src/lib/calc/**,src/lib/offers/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read the tests covering the module before changing it (a same-named `*.test.ts` where one exists, otherwise `calc.test.ts` holds the shared calc suite); write or adjust the test first, with the expected numbers worked by hand.
- Money maths is exact: use the helpers in `src/lib/calc/money.ts`, no floating-point shortcuts in stake/lay/commission logic.
- NEVER weaken or delete a passing test to make code pass.
- Do NOT refactor `src/lib/calc/ep/engine.ts` (spec-locked, see file header).
- Derive market outcomes from recorded results; never hardcode them (result-centric model).
- Verify with `npx vitest run` from `edgeways/`; the full suite must stay green.
